cluses-complete:p057","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p057:m0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"炳","kind":"person","person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p057","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p001:m0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"宗少文","kind":"person","person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p001:m0112","start":112,"end":114,"surface":"少文","kind":"person","person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao:p002:m0088","start":88,"end":91,"surface":"宗少文","kind":"person","person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整傳文敘事、職官與親屬語境辨識；原字保留。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao:p002:m0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"少文","kind":"person","person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整傳文敘事、職官與親屬語境辨識；原字保留。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao"},{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao:p002:m0108","start":108,"end":109,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"乳名引語含果名雙關，或可明定的發言者／受話者；不把後文梨為百果之宗的果物句強當人名。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao:p002","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangshao"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-qi054-zongce-grandfather","subject_person_id":"ou7_kzk_fb6","object_person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","predicate":"grandfather","qualifiers":{"source_term":"宋徵士炳孫也","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-054","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p055","quote":"　　宗測字敬微，南陽人，宋徵士炳孫也。世居江陵。測少靜退，不樂人間。歎曰：「家貧親老，不擇官而仕，先哲以爲美談，余竊有惑。誠不能潛感地金，冥致江鯉，但當用天道，分地利。孰能食人厚祿，憂人重事乎？」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p055:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p055:m0015"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"後文又稱祖炳及舊宅。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p001:r0125","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete:p001","start":125,"end":126,"surface":"吾","person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","referent_role":"speaker_self","quote":"敷字景胤。生而母亡，年數歲，問知之，雖童蒙，便有感慕之色。至十歲許，求母遺物，而散施已盡，唯得一扇，乃緘錄之。每至感思，輙開笥流涕。見從母，悲感嗚咽。性整貴，風韻端雅，好玄言，善屬文。初，父邵使與南陽宗少文談繫象，往復數番，少文每欲屈，握麈尾歎曰：「吾道東矣。」於是名價日重。武帝聞其美，召見奇之，曰：「真千里駒也。」以為世子中軍參軍，數見接引。累遷江夏王義恭撫軍記室參軍。義恭就文帝求一學義沙門，會敷赴假江陵，入辭，文帝令以後車載沙門往，謂曰：「道中可得言晤。」敷不奉詔，上甚不說。遷正員中書郎。敷小名查，父邵小名梨，文帝戲之曰：「查何如梨？」敷曰：「梨為百果之宗，查何可比。」","note":"依本段敘事、稱謂及語者受者定。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete","book_id":"b-songshu-046","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-046-zhangfu-complete-ws2118581"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p055","text":"　　宗測字敬微，南陽人，宋徵士炳孫也。世居江陵。測少靜退，不樂人間。歎曰：「家貧親老，不擇官而仕，先哲以爲美談，余竊有惑。誠不能潛感地金，冥致江鯉，但當用天道，分地利。孰能食人厚祿，憂人重事乎？」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":144,"last_line":144,"raw_start":7682,"raw_end":7780,"raw_character_offsets":[7682,7683,7684,7685,7686,7687,7688,7689,7690,7691,7692,7693,7694,7695,7696,7697,7698,7699,7700,7701,7702,7703,7704,7705,7706,7707,7708,7709,7710,7711,7712,7713,7714,7715,7716,7717,7718,7719,7720,7721,7722,7723,7724,7725,7726,7727,7728,7729,7730,7731,7732,7733,7734,7735,7736,7737,7738,7739,7740,7741,7742,7743,7744,7745,7746,7747,7748,7749,7750,7751,7752,7753,7754,7755,7756,7757,7758,7759,7760,7761,7762,7763,7764,7765,7766,7767,7768,7769,7770,7771,7772,7773,7774,7775,7776,7777,7778,7779],"revision_id":1762878},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p055:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"宗測","kind":"person","person_id":"ou7_kzk_fb6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p055:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"敬微","kind":"person","person_id":"ou7_kzk_fb6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p055:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"炳","kind":"person","person_id":"nwk_pqi_g48","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p055:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"測","kind":"person","person_id":"ou7_kzk_fb6","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-054","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p057","text":"　　欲遊名山，乃寫祖炳所畫尚子平圖於壁上。測長子宦在京師，知父此旨，便求祿還爲南郡丞，付以家事。刺史安陸王子敬、長史劉寅以下皆贈送之，測無所受。齎《老子》《莊子》二書自隨。子孫拜辭悲泣，測長嘯不視，遂往廬山，止祖炳舊宅。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":148,"last_line":148,"raw_start":7927,"raw_end":8037,"raw_character_offsets":[7927,7928,7929,7930,7931,7932,7933,7934,7935,7936,7937,7938,7939,7940,7941,7942,7943,7944,7945,7946,7947,7948,7949,7950,7951,7952,7953,7954,7955,7956,7957,7958,7959,7960,7961,7962,7963,7964,7965,7966,7967,7968,7969,7970,7971,7972,7973,7974,7975,7976,7977,7978,7979,7980,7981,7982,7983,7984,7985,7986,7987,7988,7989,7990,7991,7992,7993,7994,7995,7996,7997,7998,7999,8000,8001,8002,8003,8004,8005,8006,8007,8008,8009,8010,8011,8012,8013,8014,8015,8016,8017,8018,8019,8020,8021,8022,8023,8024,8025,8026,8027,8028,8029,8030,8031,80